    <p>想做什麼？</p>
    <p color="state-normal">cycle</p>
  </text>
  
  <text x="300" y="140" width="220" height="120" fill="bg-card" corner-radius="8" padding="20" font="body" color="text-muted">
    <p font="code" size="24" color="text-main">2. 收據 (Receipt)</p>
    <p>處理到哪裡？</p>
    <p color="state-warn">accepted</p>
  </text>

  <text x="540" y="140" width="220" height="120" fill="bg-card" corner-radius="8" padding="20" font="body" color="text-muted">
